---
// The install / update toast (design/components/Toast.md). Empty on purpose:
// scripts/toast.ts fills it in and shows it only when there is something to offer.
---

<aside data-toast role="status" aria-live="polite" hidden class="fixed inset-x-0 bottom-0 z-50 px-5 pb-4 wide:left-auto wide:w-full wide:max-w-lead">
  <div class="flex flex-col gap-3 rounded-md border-md border-line bg-card p-4 shadow-press">
    <p class="label" data-toast-title></p>
    <p class="caption text-muted" data-toast-text></p>
    <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-3" data-toast-actions></div>
  </div>
</aside>
